{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "230863c6-2a3b-8d48-b961-97542ae1d8f6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T10:48:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Um, I am looking for the, the inspection office? I have a number from a flyer, it is old, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Well, this is the City Clerk. We do records, licenses, council things like that. Inspections would be a different office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No way. So I dialed the wrong one. I am so sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, don't be sorry, it happens all the time with the old flyers. What do you need inspection for, if you don't mind me asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am a landlord, I have a unit and I want to ask about a rental inspection. Nothing about the storm, just the paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Then you want the Building and Zoning inspections office. Let me give you the main City Hall line and they can connect you. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, one second, I am on the speaker, my hands are, um, busy. [pause] I keep a spare charger in every room, so the phone is always on the table somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Okay, ask the operator at City Hall for Building inspections and they'll transfer you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will do that. Thank you, and sorry again for the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime, Hon. You have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:48:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
